OL,3,GNEWSAMore than a tonne of plastic
OL,4,Acleared from beaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity has removed more than a tonne
OL,7,Fof rubbish from some of the most remote
OL,8,Fcoastlines in the UK.
OL,10,FClean Ocean Sailing's team of 16
OL,11,FCornwall-based volunteers collected
OL,12,Fjust under 1.3 tonnes of plastic,
OL,13,Ffishing gear and other waste from nine
OL,14,Fislands around the Isles of Scilly
OL,15,Fduring a three-week expedition.
OL,17,FThe project builds on previous clean-up
OL,18,Fmissions in Scilly, where ocean
OL,19,Fcurrents carry debris from across the
OL,20,FAtlantic and deposit it on beaches.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
