OL,3,GNEWSAMore than a tonne of plastic
OL,4,Acleared from beaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rubbish was taken back to Cornwall
OL,7,Fon the 118-year-old sailing vessel
OL,8,FAnnette were it will be sorted, counted
OL,9,Fand recycled. It said some of the
OL,10,Frecovered plastic would be turned into
OL,11,Fproducts including kayaks, plant pots
OL,12,Fand dog leads.
